## 4. Within a second the ban is in the kernel; attacker packets now die at the NIC

[16:11:59] laptop$ sleep 2

[16:12:01] site$ sudo ./limitplane-xdp stats; grep -i ban xdp.log | tail -3
passed=736 dropped_banned=93 dropped_rate=0 banned_ips=1
