[16:12:03] attacker$ curl -s -m 5 -o /dev/null -w 'attacker HTTP: %{http_code} (000 = no answer at all)\n' http://104.208.118.64/; ping -c 3 -W 1 104.208.118.64 | tail -2
attacker HTTP: 000 (000 = no answer at all)
3 packets transmitted, 0 received, 100% packet loss, time 2024ms


[16:12:13] site$ sudo ./limitplane-xdp stats
