[16:17:26] attacker$ python3 -c "
import socket,time
s=socket.socket(socket.AF_INET,socket.SOCK_DGRAM); t=time.time()
for i in range(20000): s.sendto(b'x'*32,('104.208.118.64',9))
print('sent 20000 UDP packets in %.2fs' % (time.time()-t))"
sent 20000 UDP packets in 0.15s

[16:17:27] laptop$ sleep 1

[16:17:28] site$ sudo ./limitplane-xdp stats
